.TH hipfire-admin 1  "hipfire-admin " 
.SH NAME
hipfire\-admin \- Query the running hipfire admin API for scripts and agents
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhipfire\-admin\fR [\fB\-\-host\fR] [\fB\-\-port\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Query the running hipfire admin API for scripts and agents
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-host\fR \fI<HOST>\fR
Override admin API host. Defaults to config host, with 0.0.0.0 mapped to 127.0.0.1
.TP
\fB\-\-port\fR \fI<PORT>\fR
Override admin API port. Defaults to config port
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-status(1)
Combined status snapshot for scripts and agents
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-chat(1)
Send one non\-streaming chat request through /v1/chat/completions
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-health(1)
Raw /health payload
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-models(1)
Local model registry from the admin API
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-config(1)
Resolved runtime config
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-training(1)
Training run summaries or one run detail
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-diagnostics(1)
Filesystem, binary, kernel\-cache, lock, and log diagnostics
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-logs(1)
Tail known hipfire logs
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-get(1)
GET an arbitrary admin/server path, e.g. /admin/training/runs
.TP
hipfire\-admin\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
